    "author": "Ron",
    "description": "[purple]Domain expansion[] - Lunarians v3.82.0 (client-only, PC + mobile).\n\n[accent]Automation & Building[]\n- Auto Fill (beta) - Auto Drill - Auto Connect Conveyor - Conveyor Upgrade - Auto Container - Auto Set (config/slots)\n\n[accent]Units & Combat[]\n- Auto Unit - Auto Attack (Smart Path: fewer turrets/safer route to core, toggle; layer-by-layer formation with configurable delay) - Formations: Line, Arc, Ring, Triangle, Diamond, Box, Chevron - Auto Defence - Auto Shield - Auto Heal - Auto Unit Heal - Auto Cargo - Auto Dock - Auto Moon - Formations\n\n[accent]Economy & Resources[]\n- Auto Economy - Resource Loss Warn - Production Alert - Energy Watch - Power Link - Miner Fix/Units - Used Area\n\n[accent]QoL & Utilities[]\n- FreeCam (beta) - Units Follow Camera (beta) - Schematic Placer/Panel - Proton Schematics - Enemy Core Alert - Weather Safe - Server Guard - Chat Commands\n- Unit Conversations (EN, toggle): 5 per unit type (kept, longer) + 5 unique per pair for all combinations, partner variation; T1-T3 playful, T4-T5 serious; square speech bubbles; proximity/crowd/player-aware\n\n[accent]Social/Hub[]\n- Lunarians Hub: global chat, presence, hub features.\n\n[lightgray]Author: Ron | Java mod | minGame 154 | hidden[]",
